Pantry Raider: self-hosted food inventory and spoilage tracker

Pantry Raider is a self-hosted food inventory and spoilage tracker built
on Grocy, with optional Mealie for recipes and meal planning and local
or cloud AI for photo-based scanning. It runs on a Raspberry Pi
appliance or any Docker host, with an optional kiosk display and Stream
Deck control, and an optional Forager cloud companion for remote access
and hosted AI.

This tree contains the FastAPI service, the Forager cloud companion,
Raspberry Pi provisioning, Home Assistant integration, and the docs.
